WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.000
Welcome to FlowSight. Recover your FlowState.

2
00:00:05.240 --> 00:00:07.020
Name a task, set your goal, and

3
00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:10.300
track time. Choose normal timing or Pomodoro,

4
00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:12.000
then adjust work and breaks.

5
00:00:13.240 --> 00:00:15.310
Describe tasks and available time.

6
00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.550
Local AI proposes blocks.

7
00:00:17.830 --> 00:00:20.470
Adjust your plan, then confirm before adding it.

8
00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.110
Pair the extension for Total Focus.

9
00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:26.550
Choose blocked sites, exceptions and duration, with

10
00:00:26.550 --> 00:00:28.370
optional notification quieting.

11
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:32.070
Review recorded time, categories, your timeline, focus

12
00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:35.130
and browsing patterns. Local analysis adds context;

13
00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:36.450
you decide what it means.

14
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:39.800
Review work reports and export PDFs.

15
00:00:39.940 --> 00:00:43.240
Schedule weekly saves, record decisions, and set

16
00:00:43.240 --> 00:00:44.360
a date to review them.

17
00:00:45.240 --> 00:00:48.210
Optional Cloud adds Coach, selected team summaries

18
00:00:48.210 --> 00:00:50.290
and Google or Microsoft calendars.

19
00:00:50.330 --> 00:00:52.290
Check permissions and your plan.

20
00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.180
Link Jira or Linear with an eligible

21
00:00:55.180 --> 00:00:57.640
plan. Configure calendars for recaps.

22
00:00:57.640 --> 00:01:00.300
Notion publishing is currently unavailable.

23
00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:04.150
Manage tasks, local calendar blocks, drafts, browsing

24
00:01:04.150 --> 00:01:08.490
and memory. Confirm changes; connect AI through read-only MCP.

25
00:01:09.240 --> 00:01:12.410
Control sync, AI, analytics, exclusions and retention.

26
00:01:12.730 --> 00:01:14.190
Export or erase data.

27
00:01:14.410 --> 00:01:16.410
External AI gets reports you request.

28
00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.230
Join private leagues for focus points.

29
00:01:19.530 --> 00:01:21.050
Work details stay private.

30
00:01:21.350 --> 00:01:24.270
Adjust startup, tray, language, theme and updates.

31
00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:29.260
Recover your FlowState. Explore FlowSight at flowsight dot site.
